2. WHAT THIS LICENSE DOES NOT COVER (EXPLICIT EXCLUSIONS)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The owner **claims no ownership** of the following, and this licence does not apply to them:

  2.1 **Sound clips downloaded from public sources.** Every clip fetched from a public hosting service
      (e.g. myinstants.com) remains the right of its original owner and of whoever uploaded it. The app
      presents them for entertainment use only: they are not sold, not re-licensed, and no claim is made
      over them.
  2.2 **Sounds generated automatically by the app (synth engine).** No exclusive right is claimed over
      clips produced inside the app by its own synthesis engine, and users may freely use them in their
      own personal content.
  2.3 **User recordings.** Any audio the user records with their own microphone belongs to the user alone,
      stays on their device, and is never uploaded to any server.
  2.4 **Third-party libraries.** Such as Capacitor (@capacitor/core · android · ios · cli), which are
      governed by their own licences (MIT) as distributed in node_modules.
  2.5 **The Zalaf logo and developer name** — a mark belonging to the developer, shown only in the
      About section.
  2.6 **The launcher icon and splash screen** as displayed by the system — part of the app's identity
      under 1.4, not part of the public domain.

If you own the rights to a clip and object to its presence in the app, email MohamadZalaf@outlook.com
with the clip name or link, and we will remove it **within 72 hours** of verification, without conditions
and free of charge. (Details: publish/sounds-rights.html)

